source: components/markdown/tests/markdown.rs
expression: body
---
<p>A table reflows when annotated:</p>
<div class="reflow reflow-bp-40rem"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Department</th><th scope="col">Started</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td data-label="Name">Ada</td><td data-label="Department">Platform</td><td data-label="Started">2021</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Name">Linus</td><td data-label="Department">Kernel</td><td data-label="Started">2019</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
<p>A table without the annotation stays plain:</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>x</th><th>y</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
